Z||000002||ggarsk||04-04-2000||11:20 AM||||Yes,the sending unit for an '86 will work for the rally oil gauge. The only thing is with mine the needle pegs past 80. And it doesn't drop at idle when warmed up. It is suppossed to be an 80 psi unit. The cost for it was $32.00. If you happen to find one that doesn't peg the needle let me know.||||reg||1
